{"id":886865,"title":"46｜发布智能体：嵌入到网站中","content":"本节课介绍了如何将Dify搭建的智能体如智能客服接入个人网站。首先，在Dify平台选择发布并点击嵌入到网站，可选模式包括iframe嵌入、弹窗和Chrome扩展。以弹窗方式为例，复制JavaScript代码后，使用VSCode打开网页源码，将代码粘贴至header部分并保存。刷新页面后，右下角出现客服图标，用户点击即可与智能客服互动。测试中，智能客服能够准确回答关于AI课程特色及适合人群的问题。值得注意的是，默认设置下，智能回复会显示引用信息，对于对外服务网站来说可能不适宜。因此，建议在Dify平台关闭引用与归属功能，重新保存配置，确保用户界面更加专业整洁。通过上述步骤，可以实现简单有效的智能客服接入。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":403119,"user_name":"dxdingdu","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1287256,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"8ACB1ADDDE71CA","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/a4/58/8d2ba4b2.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1761545935,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"嵌入到网页中，怎么把user_id从业务系统传入dify","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":403118,"user_name":"dxdingdu","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1287256,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"8ACB1ADDDE71CA","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/a4/58/8d2ba4b2.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1761545213,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"请问dify发布后，嵌入到第三方系统， 怎么用第三方账号登录？","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":402962,"user_name":"杏林君","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1773407,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"9915CB432073BB","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83erbmQxAz3RgFjquBMYabsJsk0516JibqYWb5SUCFSPoOKueRaFbON6Tn2OhyYgia9tcibEKSYY8yxAiag/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1760612611,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"使用弹窗方式嵌入到网页中，但是刷新页面只有图标显示，点击图标没有出现弹窗","like_count":0}]}